  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "When you feel connected to the other people on your team, you are more likely to feel like you belong. The goal is to overcome the physical distance between you and other members of your team by developing stronger relationships that are a balance between personal and professional.\n\n### Develop a personal connection\n\nSeek opportunities to understand each team member. Get to know their likes, values, and goals. Share your own interests. Have lunch with a different person from your team each week.\n\n### Have fun\n\nParticipate in or create opportunities to have fun together. Organize happy hours or other casual events that let your team to enjoy and get to know each other better.\n\n### Be authentic\n\nYour team cannot connect with you if they do not know you. Speak openly and honestly. Share your ideas, concerns and plans. Be yourself.",
